Q: How to use configuration values in Spring Boot test SQL scripts? A: <p>You can update the table column value with the configuration value after the data gets inserted by @Sql annotation.</p>
<p>In you test class:</p>
<pre><code>@Value(&quot;${example.configuration.value}&quot;)
private String configValue;
@BeforeAll
void fixUp(@Autowired JdbcTemplate jdbc) {
    jdbc.update(&lt;&lt;update statement using configValue&gt;&gt;);
}
</code></pre>
